<title>USA: Andrx Corp cuts Q4 loss to $0.08/shr.</title>
<headline>Andrx Corp cuts Q4 loss to $0.08/shr.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	   Year Ended</p>
<p>			 December 31,	     December 31,</p>
<p>		    1996	   1995	   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Total revenues</p>
<p>	    $26,050,400  $16,265,800  $88,976,700   $53,161,500</p>
<p> Net loss (1,124,700)  (2,302,700)  (4,027,700)   (5,187,000)</p>
<p>Net loss per share</p>
<p>		   (0.08)	 (0.23)	 (0.33)	  (0.55)</p>
<p> Avg shrs  13,390,100   10,055,600   12,148,000     9,446,800</p>
<p>NOTE: The company's initial public offering was in June 1996.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 results include a $1.2 million provision for legal fees related to a patent suit filed against the company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
